# 白名单模式:默认全忽略,显式放行
*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# 代码
!/_code/
!/_code/**

# 数据集(当前版本)。v0.1 的数据文件不重复入库,可从 commit 70f9c20 恢复
!/_data/
!/_data/volve_causal_v0.2/
!/_data/volve_causal_v0.2/**

# 登记与方法论
!/_meta/
!/_meta/**
!/_codemap.md
!/_codebook/
!/_codebook/**
!/_wiki-methodology/
!/_wiki-methodology/_top/
!/_wiki-methodology/_top/_task_plan.md
!/_wiki-methodology/_top/_findings/
!/_wiki-methodology/_top/_findings/**
!/_wiki-methodology/_top/_decisions/
!/_wiki-methodology/_top/_decisions/**
!/_wiki-methodology/_top/_GOAL.md
!/_wiki-methodology/_wiki/
!/_wiki-methodology/_wiki/**
!/_wiki-methodology/_tests/
!/_wiki-methodology/_tests/**

# 文献:清单与笔记入库, 全文不入库(见文件末尾)
!/_refs/
!/_refs/OUR_DATA_INVENTORY.md
!/_refs/_index.md
!/_refs/_notes/
!/_refs/_notes/**

# 测试:代码与小体积证据入库
!/_tests/
!/_tests/**
# 但模拟 deck 与二进制输出不入库 —— 同 _sandbox 理由:体积大且可由
# patch_eclipse_deck.py + docker 重建。forecast_review_20260822 是 5 份
# Norne deck 副本(单份 GRDECL 11MB),共约 200MB,不应进 GitHub。
/_tests/_artifacts/**/INCLUDE/
/_tests/_artifacts/**/out/
/_tests/_artifacts/**/*.DATA
/_tests/_artifacts/**/*.EGRID
/_tests/_artifacts/**/*.INIT
/_tests/_artifacts/**/*.UNRST
/_tests/_artifacts/**/*.UNSMRY
/_tests/_artifacts/**/*.SMSPEC
/_tests/_artifacts/**/*.GRDECL
# 上游 Norne 说明文档,5 份副本共 6.5MB,可从 OPM norne 仓库获取
/_tests/_artifacts/**/Norne_model_for_atw2013.pdf

# 实验证据(小 JSON/CSV,不含权重与中间张量)
!/_pipelines/
!/_pipelines/**/
!/_pipelines/**/results.json
!/_pipelines/**/*.csv

# 论文核心实验数据(登记在 _meta/_data_registry.yml:gaia_arms_F2 / gaia_nonllm_baselines)。
# 20 次三臂闭环轨迹 + 三条非 LLM 基线 + 连通性制图,共约 250KB,必须入库以支持复现。
!/_pipelines/gaia_decision.yml
!/_pipelines/fc_team/loop_F2*.json
!/_pipelines/fc_team/cartography.json
!/_pipelines/fc_team/tilt_bins.json
!/_pipelines/fc_baselines/baselines_v2.json
# theta 存在 npz 里,gaia.py 的 tilt 列要读它;共 576KB,入库才能在新克隆上跑出完整表
!/_pipelines/fc_decide/sim/team_F2*.npz
!/_pipelines/fc_decide/sim/baseline.npz

# legacy 只留 tombstone,不重复入库归档数据
!/_legacy/
!/_legacy/**/
!/_legacy/**/README.md
/_legacy/**/volve_causal_v0.1/

# 论文正文与正文图
!/_paper/
!/_paper/**
!/_figures/
!/_figures/paper/
!/_figures/paper/**

# 大文件与派生物不进 git
_outputs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 文献全文是 Elsevier 订阅内容, 仅本机研究用, 绝不入库
/_refs/_fulltext/

# 模拟产物体积大且可由 patch_eclipse_deck.py + docker 重建, 不入库
/_sandbox/
